        "Description": "Well well well, looks like someone has been handed a special contract.\rYou will be infiltrating a Templar hideout and not only will you be taking out one of their masters, Rolf Hirschmuller, but you will also have to take out a rogue assassin agent Chamberlin.\rThe hideout is disguised as a nightclub in outskirts of Berlin but there will be high security so be careful.\rBecause of high security we recommend no bodies to be found at least till you are away from the area.\rGood luck agent.",
